    {
      "id": "2122894391979446701",
      "text": "Darko isn’t sure if the Walter closeout on Brunson should’ve been a flagrant, “but it was a foul for sure.” Darko: “We had a breakdown on the defensive end. We did not cover that the way we wanted & he got an open shot. It was the right call.” Ja’Kobe called it a miscommunication",
      "url": "https://x.com/JLew1050/status/2122894391979446701",
      "published": "2026-11-18T03:27:19+00:00",
      "likes": 56,
      "author": "Josh Lewenberg",
      "handle": "JLew1050",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730387193397395456/J8sVOvtM_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122891452833489253",
      "text": "Rajakovic says that starting Murray-Boyles and bringing Poeltl off the bench was more of a matchup thing vs the Knicks/Towns these past 2 games. Doesn’t sound like that’s the long-term plan, but we’ll see.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JLew1050/status/2122891452833489253",
      "published": "2026-11-18T03:15:38+00:00",
      "likes": 67,
      "author": "Josh Lewenberg",
      "handle": "JLew1050",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730387193397395456/J8sVOvtM_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122887163654365384",
      "text": "The last time the Raptors beat New York (Jan. 22, 2023), RJ Barrett scored a game-high 30 points… for the Knicks. He and Quickley still haven’t defeated their former team. Anunoby hasn’t lost to his. The Knicks have now won 15 straight meetings.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JLew1050/status/2122887163654365384",
      "published": "2026-11-18T02:58:35+00:00",
      "likes": 100,
      "author": "Josh Lewenberg",
      "handle": "JLew1050",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730387193397395456/J8sVOvtM_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122885524147106124",
      "text": "Ja'Kobe's had a fantastic game... but fouling a jump shooter in a tie game with 90 seconds left... the small details, man! Brunson knocks down the 3 and Walter gets hit with a fragrant. 4-point play, Knicks ball. Rough rough sequence.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JLew1050/status/2122885524147106124",
      "published": "2026-11-18T02:52:04+00:00",
      "likes": 79,
      "author": "Josh Lewenberg",
      "handle": "JLew1050",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730387193397395456/J8sVOvtM_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122875158209667410",
      "text": "Career-best 7 made 3s for Walter now. He's 7-for-10 with 23 points (4 away from his career-high) in 24 minutes. Still 3 minutes left in the 3rd quarter.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JLew1050/status/2122875158209667410",
      "published": "2026-11-18T02:10:53+00:00",
      "likes": 9,
      "author": "Josh Lewenberg",
      "handle": "JLew1050",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730387193397395456/J8sVOvtM_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Ja'Kobe Walter having himself a game. He came in shooting 14-for-54 (26%) from 3-point range in the month of November, including 2-for-12 over the last 2 games. He's 6-for-8 in 20 minutes tonight. The 6 made 3s match a career-high.",
      "quoted_author": "Josh Lewenberg",
      "quoted_handle": "JLew1050"
